    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n****VIRTUAL TOUR AVAILABLE****\n\nDNG Leonard & Heaslip are delighted to bring to market this one of a kind property in Bushy Park. Sitting on a elevated site with uninterrupted views over Lough Corrib, this fantastic home at Gortacleva is positioned to take full advantage of its spectacular setting. Originally constructed c1971, there are expansive windows throughout the house with captivating views of the surrounding landscape and Lough Corrib. The accomodation comprises of a wide entrance hall which leads into the main reception room, offering two large picture windows with breathtaking views. This leads to a rear kitchen and adjoining family room also to the rear. Completing the downstairs living accomodation is a main bathroom with a shower, downstairs bedroom/office/playroom and utility room. Upstairs there are three double rooms and a family bathroom. Outside, there is a large garage with ample storage space and suitable for conversion. There is also ample parking and fantastic front and side gardens.\n\nThe nearby Sportsgrounds at Dangan, provides a range of activities, including rugby, GAA, soccer, athletics, and university sporting events, along with access to scenic riverside walks along the River Corrib, making it ideal for walkers and joggers. The Glenlo Abbey Hotel & Estate, with its Michelin Star 'The Pullman' restaurant & Driving Range, is just a mere 1km from the property.\n\nThere are many schools to choose from within Galway City, the nearest to this property is St James NS in Bushypark and Galway Educate together in Newcastle.\n\nViewing is advised.\n\n• Detached• Elevated site• Bushy Park• Large Garden• Lake views• Built 1971• OFCH• Garage\n\nDNG Leonard & Heaslip for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of the property whose Agents they are, give notice that: (i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute part of, an offer or contract. (ii) Any intending purchasers or tenants must not rely the descriptions, dimensions, references to condition or necessary permissions for use and occupation as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. (iii) No person in the employment of DNG Leonard & Heaslip has any authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this development. DNG Leonard & Heaslip accept no liability (including liability to any prospective purchaser or lessee by reason of negligence or negligent misstatement) for loss or damage caused by any statements, opinions, information or other matters (expressed or implied) arising out of, contained in or derived from, or for any omissions from this brochure."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.2 x 3.3\nWide entrance hall with carpet floor.\n\nLiving Room - 3.9 x 7.4\nLarge living room with 2 large windows, carpet floor and fireplace.\n\nKitchen - 3.6 x 2.3\nRear facing with built in kitchen units and window.\n\nTv Room - 4.2 x 3.5\nRear facing room with carpet floor, radiator and window.\n\nBedroom / Office / Playroom - 3.7 x 2.6\nFront facing room with carpet floor and built in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - 2.5 x .9\nWith whb, wc and shower.\n\nUtility Room - 3.1 x 2.5\nRear facing with back door access.\n\nUpstairs: Landing - 4.7 x 2.1\nWith carpet floor and hotpress/storage.\n\nBedroom One - 3.2 x 4.1\nLarge rear facing double room with carpet floor and radiator.\n\nBedroom Two - 4.2 x 2.1\nDouble room with carpet floor and window.\n\nBedroom Three - 4.0 x 4.2\nLarge double room with carpet floor, window and radiator.\n\nBathroom - 2.9 x 2.2\nRear facing with whb, wc, bath/shower and window.\n\n"
